Yoursun Loan offers secure and accessible online lending services tailored for the Philippines. Trustworthy, transparent, and swift access to funds for your financial needs.

Filipino citizens
18~60 years old
ID ONE government-issued ID
stable income

Yoursun Loan distinguishes itself by providing flexible loan options, allowing borrowers to select terms and amounts that best suit their financial situations.

Loan amount: ₱1000-₱20000;
Period: 91-180 days;
Service fee: ₱10-₱400; 
Daily loan interest rate: 0.09%; 
Annual percentage rate(APR): 34.40%.

For example: When a user (borrower) applies for a loan service with a term of 91 days and a total amount of ₱15,000, after deducting a service fee of ₱150 (the service fee includes credit scoring system fees, account fees, third-party fees, etc.) , the actual amount received was ₱14850. The user (borrower) needs to repay ₱5,000 and ₱405 interest every 30 days (monthly). The repayment is divided into 3 installments, and the final total repayment amount is ₱16,215.

Email:yoursunloanapp@outlook.com
